NAME
    gcloud redis acl-policies - manage ACL policies of Memorystore for Redis
        Cluster instances

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud redis acl-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage ACL policies of Memorystore for Redis Cluster instances.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Redis ACL Policy.

     delete
        Delete a Redis ACL Policy.

     describe
        Show metadata for a Memorystore for Redis Cluster ACL policy.

     list
        List Redis ACL Policies.

     update
        Update aclPolicies.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha redis acl-policies

        $ gcloud beta redis acl-policies

